OL,3,ASinger Michael Kiwanuka reveals he is
OL,4,Arecovering from a stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FAward-winning singer-songwriter Michael
OL,7,FKiwanuka has revealed he has suffered a
OL,8,Fstroke and faces a "long, tough journey
OL,9,Fahead" to recover.
OL,11,FThe 39-year-old from London, who won
OL,12,Fthe Mercury Prize in 2020 and has been
OL,13,Fnominated for five Brit Awards, said in
OL,14,Fan Instagram post that the stroke
OL,15,Foccurred "a few months ago" and was
OL,16,Fcaused "by a bleed in my brain brought
OL,17,Fon by high blood pressure".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
